      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Assess this purchase order for supply-chain / shipment risk.\n\nPO_Number: {{ $json.PO_Number }}\nSupplier_Name: {{ $json.Supplier_Name }}\nSupplier_Email: {{ $json.Supplier_Email }}\nSKU: {{ $json.SKU }}\nQty: {{ $json.Qty }}\nExpected_Date: {{ $json.Expected_Date }}\nASN_Status: {{ $json.ASN_Status }}\nLast_Shipment_Update: {{ $json.Last_Shipment_Update }}\nToday: {{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd') }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a supply-chain operations assistant that reviews purchase orders (POs) for shipment risk.\n\nConsider Expected_Date (how close or overdue the delivery is relative to Today), ASN_Status (an empty status or anything other than \"in-transit\"/\"delivered\" is a concern), Last_Shipment_Update (stale updates > 5 days are a concern), Supplier_Name, SKU and Qty.\n\nClassify each PO's risk_level as exactly one of:\n- NORMAL: on track, no supplier communication needed.\n- FOLLOW_UP: minor concern, a polite status request is warranted.\n- ESCALATE: high risk (missing ASN with imminent/overdue ETA, or no movement), an urgent supplier request is required.\n\nReturn these fields:\n- risk_level: NORMAL | FOLLOW_UP | ESCALATE\n- risk_reason: one or two concise sentences explaining the risk.\n- recommended_action: the concrete next step for the buyer.\n- supplier_email_body: For FOLLOW_UP or ESCALATE, write a complete, professional plain-text email to the supplier requesting the required shipment/ASN/ETA information (greeting, PO number, SKU, quantity, the specific information needed, a clear response deadline, and a professional sign-off from the Procurement team). For NORMAL, return an empty string."
        }
      },
